From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] feat(dev): add VKD3D_DIAGNOSTICS master switch
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dev only, not for release builds.

Problem: the black-screen diagnostics added for Requiem (N§29) were compiled
in and on by default.

Root cause: n/a (diagnostic).

Fix: vkd3d_diagnostics_enabled() reads VKD3D_DIAGNOSTICS=1, off by default.
It gates the thread sampler, fence-stall and queue-activity reports, the
backbuffer-draw logger, the event recorder and the GPU readback added in the
following commits. Defined for _WIN32 builds only.

Verified by: OVERVIEW.md section 4 ("vkd3d diagnostics bundle").

Off switch: off by default; VKD3D_DIAGNOSTICS=1 enables.
---
 include/private/vkd3d_debug.h |  1 +
 libs/vkd3d-common/debug.c     | 15 +++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/private/vkd3d_debug.h b/include/private/vkd3d_debug.h
index 4fdaa0f..f21f9e7 100644
--- a/include/private/vkd3d_debug.h
+++ b/include/private/vkd3d_debug.h
@@ -75,6 +75,7 @@ void vkd3d_dbg_flush(void);
 /* Always-on, deduplicated failure log shared with MoltenVK. VKD3D_FAILURE_LOG = path or "0";
  * default C:\\gfx-failures.log. */
 bool vkd3d_failure_log_enabled(void);
+bool vkd3d_diagnostics_enabled(void);
 void vkd3d_failure_log(const char *category, const char *fmt, ...) VKD3D_PRINTF_FUNC(2, 3);
 
 #define VKD3D_DEBUG_BUFFER_SIZE 512
diff --git a/libs/vkd3d-common/debug.c b/libs/vkd3d-common/debug.c
index e4d1087..db69b50 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d-common/debug.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d-common/debug.c
@@ -711,3 +711,18 @@ union vkd3d_config_flags vkd3d_parse_debug_options(const char *string,
 
     return flags;
 }
+
+#ifdef _WIN32
+/* Master switch for the black-screen diagnostics (fence/queue reports, backbuffer-draw logger, event recording,
+ * GPU readback, thread sampler). Off by default; VKD3D_DIAGNOSTICS=1 enables. */
+bool vkd3d_diagnostics_enabled(void)
+{
+    static int enabled = -1;
+    if (enabled < 0)
+    {
+        char env[16];
+        enabled = vkd3d_get_env_var("VKD3D_DIAGNOSTICS", env, sizeof(env)) && env[0] == '1';
+    }
+    return enabled;
+}
+#endif
